# Amazon EDA Project

## Objective
Performed Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on Amazon product dataset using Python.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Analysis Performed
- Data Cleaning
- Missing Value Handling
- Product Rating Analysis
- Price Analysis
- Category Analysis
- Data Visualization

## Key Insights
- Electronics category had most products
- Ratings mainly ranged between 4.0–4.5
- Expensive products were not always highest rated
